  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Singletons Replaced: The old Singleton pattern has been removed and replaced with a more flexible Service system.\n\t\t- Service Instances: The following Singleton instances have been removed:\n\t\t--- Engine\n\t\t--- Log\n\t\t--- Rand\n\t\t--- Clock\n\t\t--- Assets\n\t\t--- Signal\n\t\t--- Renderer\n\t\t--- Coroutine\n\t\t--- SoundManager\n\t\t--- ScreenManager\n\t\t- These have now been refactored into the Service system for better management and scalability.\n\t\t- Service States: Added different states for services:\n\t\t- New states for updating and initialization were introduced.\n\t\t- Services can now be passively drawn, improving the overall flexibility for handling various service types.\n\t\t- Service Collection Manager: Introduced Service Collection and Service Manager to better organize and manage the lifecycle of services.\n\t\t- Fluent Interface: A Fluent Interface has been added to streamline the process of configuring engine settings with error checking for safer and more intuitive configurations.\n\t\t- Service Attribute: The SingletonAttribute has been replaced with the new ServiceAttribute to reflect the updated service management approach.",
